<!--
  Values that are not of their schema type, as a delivery may write them by
  mistake: a time and a duration that are no xs:time and no xs:duration (XML
  Schema 1.0 Part 2, 3.2.8 and 3.2.6), a validity period of a date without its
  time, a list of positions that holds no number (gml:posList, a list of
  doubles), and a transport mode the enumeration does not list, white space
  around it. Each is kept as written rather than refused, so that the document
  reads and writes back unchanged; what a value means is read from it on
  demand.
  Written for netex-rs's tests (MIT OR Apache-2.0); places, lines and times
  are invented.
-->
